{"seq":1,"slug":"revenue-metrics-ltv","title":"收入指标与 LTV 建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/monetization-analytics/revenue-metrics-ltv","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"收入指标与-ltv-建模\">收入指标与 LTV 建模</h1><h2 id=\"ltv-游戏商业的北极星指标\">LTV：游戏商业的北极星指标</h2><p>LTV（Lifetime Value，用户生命周期价值）是<a href=\"../foundations/game-metrics-taxonomy\">指标体系</a>中的最高层综合指标——它回答了&quot;一个玩家从进入到流失，总共能为游戏贡献多少价值&quot;这一核心商业问题。</p>\n<p>LTV 的战略意义在于它是<strong>获客投入的决策锚点</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"黄金法则：LTV &gt; CAC（用户获取成本）&#10;健康比例：LTV / CAC ≥ 3（留有安全边际）&#10;回收周期：Payback Period &lt; 180 天（资金效率）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>黄金法则：LTV > CAC（用户获取成本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>健康比例：LTV / CAC ≥ 3（留有安全边际）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>回收周期：Payback Period &#x3C; 180 天（资金效率）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果 LTV = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>而</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 而 CAC =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">而</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span>3，意味着每获取一个用户净赚 $2；但如果回收周期是 365 天，现金流压力仍然巨大。因此，LTV 建模需要同时考虑<strong>总量</strong>和<strong>时间分布</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>收入指标与 LTV 建模围绕以下关键概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LTV（用户生命周期价值）</strong>：一个玩家从进入到流失创造的总价值，是获客决策的锚点</li>\n<li><strong>CAC（用户获取成本）</strong>：获取一个用户的平均支出；LTV/CAC ≥ 3 是健康增长的公认门槛</li>\n<li><strong>ARPU / ARPPU / ARPDAU</strong>：全用户平均、付费用户平均、每日活用户价值密度——三者口径不同不可混用</li>\n<li><strong>CVR（付费转化率）</strong>：付费用户占活跃用户的比例，是收入拆解中的第二个杠杆</li>\n<li><strong>Cohort LTV</strong>：按批次累计的 LTV 曲线，本质是留存曲线与 ARPDAU 的积分</li>\n<li><strong>回收周期（Payback Period）</strong>：从获客到 LTV 超过 CAC 所需天数，决定现金流健康度</li>\n<li><strong>渠道 LTV</strong>：不同获客渠道的用户价值差异巨大，决定买量预算的分配</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"基础收入指标\">基础收入指标</h2><h3 id=\"指标定义与计算\">指标定义与计算</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>时间粒度</th>\n<th>核心用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Revenue</td>\n<td>总收入（IAP + IAA + 订阅）</td>\n<td>日/周/月</td>\n<td>绝对规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARPU</td>\n<td>Revenue / DAU</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>全用户平均价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARPPU</td>\n<td>Revenue / Paying Users</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>付费用户消费能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARPDAU</td>\n<td>Daily Revenue / DAU</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>日活用户价值密度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CVR</td>\n<td>Paying Users / DAU × 100%</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>付费渗透率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARPAS</td>\n<td>Revenue / Sessions</td>\n<td>每 session</td>\n<td>单次打开价值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"收入拆解-revenue-decomposition\">收入拆解（Revenue Decomposition）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"日收入 = DAU × CVR × ARPPU&#10;       = DAU × (首充用户 + 复购用户) / DAU × 人均消费&#10;       = 首充收入 + 复购收入 + 广告收入&#10;&#10;其中：&#10;首充收入 = DAU × 首充转化率 × 首充客单价&#10;复购收入 = 付费用户数 × 复购率 × 复购客单价&#10;广告收入 = DAU × 广告渗透率 × 人均广告展示次数 × eCPM / 1000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>日收入 = DAU × CVR × ARPPU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       = DAU × (首充用户 + 复购用户) / DAU × 人均消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       = 首充收入 + 复购收入 + 广告收入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>其中：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>首充收入 = DAU × 首充转化率 × 首充客单价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>复购收入 = 付费用户数 × 复购率 × 复购客单价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>广告收入 = DAU × 广告渗透率 × 人均广告展示次数 × eCPM / 1000</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"付费漏斗分析\">付费漏斗分析</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[全体活跃用户 DAU 100%] --&gt; B[进入商店浏览 30-50%]&#10;    B --&gt; C[查看商品详情 15-25%]&#10;    C --&gt; D[点击购买 5-10%]&#10;    D --&gt; E[完成支付 3-7%]&#10;    E --&gt; F[二次付费 1-3%]&#10;    F --&gt; G[多次付费成为大R 0.5-2%]\">graph TD\n    A[全体活跃用户 DAU 100%] --&gt; B[进入商店浏览 30-50%]\n    B --&gt; C[查看商品详情 15-25%]\n    C --&gt; D[点击购买 5-10%]\n    D --&gt; E[完成支付 3-7%]\n    E --&gt; F[二次付费 1-3%]\n    F --&gt; G[多次付费成为大R 0.5-2%]</pre><p>每一步的转化率都是优化空间。最高 ROI 的通常是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>商店曝光率</strong>：很多玩家从未进入过商店 → 在自然时刻引导</li>\n<li><strong>支付完成率</strong>：发起支付但未完成 → 优化支付流程、增加支付方式</li>\n<li><strong>首充到复购</strong>：首次付费后不再复购 → 首充后立即展示高价值回馈</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cohort-ltv-计算\">Cohort LTV 计算</h2><h3 id=\"基本方法-cohort-累计法\">基本方法：Cohort 累计法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def compute_cohort_ltv(revenue_data, cohort_date, max_days=180):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    计算指定 Cohort 的累计 LTV 曲线&#10;    revenue_data: DataFrame [player_id, date, revenue]&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    cohort_users = revenue_data[revenue_data.install_date == cohort_date].player_id.unique()&#10;    cohort_size = len(cohort_users)&#10;&#10;    ltv_curve = []&#10;    for day_n in range(max_days + 1):&#10;        target_date = cohort_date + timedelta(days=day_n)&#10;        day_revenue = revenue_data[&#10;            (revenue_data.player_id.isin(cohort_users)) &amp;&#10;            (revenue_data.date == target_date)&#10;        ].revenue.sum()&#10;&#10;        cumulative_revenue = sum(r for _, r in ltv_curve) + day_revenue&#10;        ltv_per_user = cumulative_revenue / cohort_size&#10;&#10;        ltv_curve.append({&#10;            &#39;day_n&#39;: day_n,&#10;            &#39;daily_revenue&#39;: day_revenue,&#10;            &#39;cumulative_revenue&#39;: cumulative_revenue,&#10;            &#39;ltv&#39;: ltv_per_user,&#10;        })&#10;&#10;    return pd.DataFrame(ltv_curve)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_cohort_ltv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(revenue_data, cohort_date, max_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">180</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    计算指定 Cohort 的累计 LTV 曲线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    revenue_data: DataFrame [player_id, date, revenue]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cohort_users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue_data[revenue_data.install_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_date].player_id.unique()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cohort_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cohort_users)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ltv_curve </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> day_n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(max_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">day_n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        day_revenue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue_data[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            (revenue_data.player_id.isin(cohort_users)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            (revenue_data.date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ].revenue.sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cumulative_revenue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ltv_curve) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> day_revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ltv_per_user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cumulative_revenue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ltv_curve.append({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'day_n'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: day_n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'daily_revenue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: day_revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'cumulative_revenue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: cumulative_revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'ltv'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ltv_per_user,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame(ltv_curve)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ltv-与留存的数学关系\">LTV 与留存的数学关系</h3><p>LTV 的计算本质上是留存曲线与 ARPDAU 的积分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"LTV(D_n) = Σ(d=0 to n) [Retention(d) × ARPDAU(d)]&#10;&#10;如果假设 ARPDAU 稳定（简化）：&#10;LTV(D_n) ≈ ARPDAU × Σ(d=0 to n) Retention(d)&#10;          = ARPDAU × 累计留存天数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LTV(D_n) = Σ(d=0 to n) [Retention(d) × ARPDAU(d)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>如果假设 ARPDAU 稳定（简化）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LTV(D_n) ≈ ARPDAU × Σ(d=0 to n) Retention(d)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          = ARPDAU × 累计留存天数</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这就是为什么<a href=\"../player-behavior/retention-engagement-analysis\">留存分析</a>是 LTV 建模的基石——留存曲线的形态直接决定了 LTV 的上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ltv-预测模型\">LTV 预测模型</h2><h3 id=\"为什么需要预测-ltv\">为什么需要预测 LTV</h3><p>真实 LTV 需要等到用户完全流失后才能计算，这可能需要数月甚至数年。但获客决策（花多少钱买量）需要在 D0-D7 就做出。因此我们需要用<strong>早期数据预测长期 LTV</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法一-留存曲线外推法\">方法一：留存曲线外推法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy.optimize import curve_fit&#10;&#10;def power_law_retention(day, a, b):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;幂律衰减模型拟合留存曲线&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    return a * (day + 1) ** (-b)&#10;&#10;def predict_ltv_from_retention(observed_retention, arpdau, predict_days=365):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    用已观察到的留存数据（如 D1-D30）外推长期留存&#10;    然后乘以 ARPDAU 得到预测 LTV&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    days_observed = np.arange(1, len(observed_retention) + 1)&#10;&#10;    # 拟合幂律衰减&#10;    popt, pcov = curve_fit(&#10;        power_law_retention,&#10;        days_observed,&#10;        observed_retention,&#10;        p0=[1.0, 0.5],&#10;        maxfev=10000&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    # 外推&#10;    all_days = np.arange(1, predict_days + 1)&#10;    predicted_retention = power_law_retention(all_days, *popt)&#10;    predicted_retention = np.clip(predicted_retention, 0, 1)&#10;&#10;    # LTV = 累计留存 × ARPDAU&#10;    predicted_ltv = np.cumsum(predicted_retention) * arpdau&#10;&#10;    return predicted_ltv\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.optimize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> curve_fit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> power_law_retention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(day, a, b):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"幂律衰减模型拟合留存曲线\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (day </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> predict_ltv_from_retention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(observed_retention, arpdau, predict_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">365</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    用已观察到的留存数据（如 D1-D30）外推长期留存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    然后乘以 ARPDAU 得到预测 LTV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    days_observed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.arange(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(observed_retention) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 拟合幂律衰减</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    popt, pcov </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> curve_fit(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        power_law_retention,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        days_observed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        observed_retention,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        p0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        maxfev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 外推</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    all_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.arange(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, predict_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    predicted_retention </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> power_law_retention(all_days, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">popt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    predicted_retention </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.clip(predicted_retention, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # LTV = 累计留存 × ARPDAU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    predicted_ltv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.cumsum(predicted_retention) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arpdau</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predicted_ltv</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-分段回归法\">方法二：分段回归法</h3><p>不同来源/品质的用户，其 LTV 增长曲线形态不同。分段回归允许对不同 segment 使用不同的拟合参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def segment_ltv_prediction(cohort_data, segments):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;按 segment 分别预测 LTV&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    predictions = {}&#10;&#10;    for segment_name, segment_users in segments.items():&#10;        segment_retention = compute_retention_curve(cohort_data, segment_users)&#10;        segment_arpdau = compute_arpdau(cohort_data, segment_users)&#10;&#10;        predictions[segment_name] = predict_ltv_from_retention(&#10;            segment_retention, segment_arpdau&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    return predictions\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> segment_ltv_prediction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cohort_data, segments):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"按 segment 分别预测 LTV\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    predictions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> segment_name, segment_users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> segments.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        segment_retention </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute_retention_curve(cohort_data, segment_users)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        segment_arpdau </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute_arpdau(cohort_data, segment_users)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        predictions[segment_name] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predict_ltv_from_retention(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            segment_retention, segment_arpdau</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictions</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法三-ml-预测-早期-ltv-估算\">方法三：ML 预测（早期 LTV 估算）</h3><p>用 D3-D7 的行为特征预测 D90/D180 的 LTV：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import lightgbm as lgb&#10;&#10;def train_ltv_predictor(X_train, y_train_ltv_d90):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    训练 LTV 预测模型&#10;    特征 X: D7 内的行为数据&#10;    标签 y: D90 真实 LTV（历史 Cohort 数据）&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    params = {&#10;        &#39;objective&#39;: &#39;regression&#39;,&#10;        &#39;metric&#39;: &#39;mae&#39;,&#10;        &#39;max_depth&#39;: 6,&#10;        &#39;num_leaves&#39;: 31,&#10;        &#39;learning_rate&#39;: 0.05,&#10;        &#39;feature_fraction&#39;: 0.8,&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    train_data = lgb.Dataset(X_train, y_train_ltv_d90)&#10;    model = lgb.train(params, train_data, num_boost_round=500)&#10;&#10;    return model&#10;&#10;# 关键特征（按重要度排序）：&#10;# 1. D7 内总付费金额&#10;# 2. D7 内 session 总数&#10;# 3. 首次付费时间（越早 LTV 越高）&#10;# 4. D7 留存（是否回来）&#10;# 5. 社交行为密度\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lightgbm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lgb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> train_ltv_predictor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(X_train, y_train_ltv_d90):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    训练 LTV 预测模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    特征 X: D7 内的行为数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    标签 y: D90 真实 LTV（历史 Cohort 数据）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'objective'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'regression'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'metric'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mae'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'max_depth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'num_leaves'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'learning_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'feature_fraction'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    train_data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lgb.Dataset(X_train, y_train_ltv_d90)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lgb.train(params, train_data, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_boost_round</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关键特征（按重要度排序）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. D7 内总付费金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. D7 内 session 总数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 首次付费时间（越早 LTV 越高）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. D7 留存（是否回来）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 5. 社交行为密度</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"回收周期分析-payback-period\">回收周期分析（Payback Period）</h2><p>回收周期是从获客到 LTV 超过 CAC 的天数。它决定了现金流健康度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def compute_payback_period(ltv_curve, cac):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;计算回收周期&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    for day, ltv in enumerate(ltv_curve):&#10;        if ltv &gt;= cac:&#10;            return day&#10;    return float(&#39;inf&#39;)  # 永远无法回收&#10;&#10;# 示例&#10;# CAC = $3.00&#10;# D30 LTV = $2.50 → 尚未回收&#10;# D60 LTV = $3.20 → 回收周期 ≈ 55 天&#10;# D180 LTV = $5.00 → 总 ROI = 67%\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_payback_period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ltv_curve, cac):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"计算回收周期\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> day, ltv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ltv_curve):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ltv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cac:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> day</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 永远无法回收</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CAC = $3.00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># D30 LTV = $2.50 → 尚未回收</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># D60 LTV = $3.20 → 回收周期 ≈ 55 天</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># D180 LTV = $5.00 → 总 ROI = 67%</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>回收周期的战略影响</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回收周期</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>资金策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt;30 天</td>\n<td>极佳</td>\n<td>可大规模激进买量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30-90 天</td>\n<td>健康</td>\n<td>稳健买量，关注现金流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90-180 天</td>\n<td>勉强</td>\n<td>需要充足资金储备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;180 天</td>\n<td>危险</td>\n<td>除非有战略级融资否则不可持续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"渠道-ltv-分析\">渠道 LTV 分析</h2><p>不同获客渠道获取的用户质量差异巨大：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按渠道对比 D90 LTV&#10;SELECT&#10;  attribution_source,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT player_id) AS users,&#10;  AVG(cac) AS avg_cac,&#10;  AVG(ltv_d90) AS avg_ltv_d90,&#10;  AVG(ltv_d90) / AVG(cac) AS roi,&#10;  PERCENTILE_CONT(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY payback_days) AS median_payback&#10;FROM player_ltv_report&#10;GROUP BY attribution_source&#10;ORDER BY roi DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按渠道对比 D90 LTV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attribution_source,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> player_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cac) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_cac,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ltv_d90) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_ltv_d90,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ltv_d90) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cac) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payback_days) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> median_payback</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> player_ltv_report</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attribution_source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>CAC</th>\n<th>D90 LTV</th>\n<th>ROI</th>\n<th>回收周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自然流量</td>\n<td>$0.50</td>\n<td>$4.20</td>\n<td>740%</td>\n<td>8天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apple Search Ads</td>\n<td>$2.80</td>\n<td>$5.10</td>\n<td>82%</td>\n<td>52天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Facebook</td>\n<td>$3.50</td>\n<td>$4.80</td>\n<td>37%</td>\n<td>67天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unity Ads</td>\n<td>$1.80</td>\n<td>$3.20</td>\n<td>78%</td>\n<td>41天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Influencer</td>\n<td>$4.00</td>\n<td>$6.50</td>\n<td>63%</td>\n<td>58天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与其他模块的关系\">与其他模块的关系</h2><ul>\n<li>LTV 的准确性依赖<a href=\"../player-behavior/retention-engagement-analysis\">留存分析</a>的留存曲线质量</li>\n<li>LTV 分 segment 计算需要<a href=\"../player-behavior/player-segmentation\">玩家分群</a>的标签</li>\n<li>LTV 优化的落地手段包括<a href=\"pricing-iap-optimization\">定价优化</a>和<a href=\"ad-monetization-mediation\">广告变现</a></li>\n<li>LTV/CAC 比是<a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/\">游戏变现与运营</a>的核心决策指标</li>\n<li>LTV 预测模型的验证需要<a href=\"../live-ops/ab-testing-experimentation\">A/B 测试</a>平台</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"下一步\">下一步</h2><p>LTV 告诉我们&quot;一个用户值多少钱&quot;，但如何<strong>提升</strong>这个值？两条路径：让更多人付费（CVR↑）、让每人花更多（ARPPU↑）。继续阅读<a href=\"pricing-iap-optimization\">定价与内购优化</a>，深入探讨如何通过数据驱动的定价策略来提升变现效率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>LTV 是决策锚点</strong>：LTV &gt; CAC 是健康增长的基本条件，LTV/CAC ≥ 3 留有安全边际，回收周期 &lt;180 天保证资金效率</li>\n<li><strong>收入拆解三个杠杆</strong>：日收入 = DAU × CVR × ARPPU，任何增长策略最终都落在&quot;更多玩家、更多人付费、每人花更多&quot;三者之一</li>\n<li><strong>口径不能混</strong>：ARPU 被非付费用户稀释，ARPPU 只看付费人群，ARPDAU 是每日活的价值密度——混用会得出错误结论</li>\n<li><strong>LTV 是留存的积分</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LTV(D_n) = \\sum_{d=0}^{n} Retention(d) \\times ARPDAU(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，留存曲线形态直接决定 LTV 上限</li>\n<li><strong>真实 LTV 来得太慢，必须预测</strong>：留存外推法适合快速估算，分段回归处理群体差异，ML 用 D3-D7 特征预测 D90/D180</li>\n<li><strong>回收周期决定资金策略</strong>：&lt;30 天可激进买量，90-180 天需充足储备，&gt;180 天除非有战略融资否则不可持续</li>\n<li><strong>渠道 ROI 差异巨大</strong>：自然流量 ROI 可达数百百分比，付费渠道常在 40-80%，按 ROI 而非单纯 CAC 分配预算</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"收入指标与 LTV 建模","id":"收入指标与-ltv-建模"},{"level":2,"text":"LTV：游戏商业的北极星指标","id":"ltv-游戏商业的北极星指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基础收入指标","id":"基础收入指标"},{"level":3,"text":"指标定义与计算","id":"指标定义与计算"},{"level":3,"text":"收入拆解（Revenue Decomposition）","id":"收入拆解-revenue-decomposition"},{"level":3,"text":"付费漏斗分析","id":"付费漏斗分析"},{"level":2,"text":"Cohort LTV 计算","id":"cohort-ltv-计算"},{"level":3,"text":"基本方法：Cohort 累计法","id":"基本方法-cohort-累计法"},{"level":3,"text":"LTV 与留存的数学关系","id":"ltv-与留存的数学关系"},{"level":2,"text":"LTV 预测模型","id":"ltv-预测模型"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要预测 LTV","id":"为什么需要预测-ltv"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：留存曲线外推法","id":"方法一-留存曲线外推法"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：分段回归法","id":"方法二-分段回归法"},{"level":3,"text":"方法三：ML 预测（早期 LTV 估算）","id":"方法三-ml-预测-早期-ltv-估算"},{"level":2,"text":"回收周期分析（Payback Period）","id":"回收周期分析-payback-period"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道 LTV 分析","id":"渠道-ltv-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他模块的关系","id":"与其他模块的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"下一步","id":"下一步"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流失预测模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/player-behavior/churn-prediction-models"},"next":{"title":"定价与内购优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/monetization-analytics/pricing-iap-optimization"}}